WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:01:46.620
Submit your fanart to the Soul Contract producers here at: soulcontractanime.tumblr.com/submit

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:49.930
Soul Contract

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:54.670
12th Contract

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:58.430
subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.130
Why is it always the same vision?

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:09.770
Mommy,

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:12.850
there's a face appearing on the car window

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:13.880
Stop the nonsense

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.120
It's rude to point your finger at people

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:28.840
How troublesome, is Duanmu Xi having constipation?

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.280
Why is he not back yet?

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:33.180
- A ghost!
- Mommy, the umbrella is flying

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.000
Who shouted about haunting?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.620
If we don't earn money by today,

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:40.860
We'd surely get skinned by Director K

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:42.100
Let's go back

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.320
and claim the fees

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:43.840
Boss,

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.540
aren't you the first who screamed?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.320
Bullcrap

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.880
I was yelling to charge forth

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.080
I'm warning you not to insult my guts

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:51.080
Stop right there

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:51.870
Uh?

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.120
Many residents in the area

00:02:56.120 --> 00:03:00.060
witnessed a paranormal incident of an umbrella suspended in mid air

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.450
It has caught the attention of the city mayor

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.750
and he asked everyone not to blindly spread rumors about it

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.000
Landlord,

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.010
are you busy?

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.650
Just clearing up some things

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:11.540
Oh yeah

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.840
Little Yang still owed you the rent, didn't he?

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.060
I thought I'd pay for him

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.140
No need for that

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:19.600
Someone has helped him pay

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:20.400
Huh?

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.940
That man helped paid the rental

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.780
He even paid me a few extra months

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:28.340
and requested me to help keep little Yang's furnace for 49 days

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:29.960
Really?

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:32.000
Who's this fine gentleman?

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.040
A tall young man

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.020
Looks handsome

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.730
Well dressed

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.360
and speaks politely

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.580
Did you hear what he said?

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:44.880
Something about

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.420
telling us not to go again

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.660
A lone duckling on the street,

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.020
planning to run riot in my territory?

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:55.270
I've never heard of little Yang having such a friend before

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.590
Go get him

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.360
Me too

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.980
Why would anyone simply

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.820
give away such a huge sum of money?

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.160
I think it's strange

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.980
As for the furnace,

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:07.070
he earnestly thanked me with a big bow

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:08.000
I asked him

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.030
what's his relationship with little Yang

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.410
He only said one word

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.300
What did he say?

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:16.210
He said Yang Jinghua was his...

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.210
Damn it

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.620
I'll let you know how good I am when I get serious

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.130
Guys,

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:33.340
let's kill him

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:40.990
Hello?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:42.580
Director K?

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:43.670
Watch him

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.380
We're just teaching a brat some lesson

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.650
What's your order?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.340
Are you insane?!

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:52.120
How dare you trouble the Duanmus?

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.100
If you wanna die,

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.820
don't drag me down too

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.800
D-Did you say

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:01.510
he's from the Duanmus?

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.790
Look at this soaring dragon
(In many Asian countries, big tattoos are associated with mafia)

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.980
I used to beat up old people
(In many Asian countries, big tattoos are associated with mafia)

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.780
Look at this wild tiger playing roshambo
(In many Asian countries, big tattoos are associated with mafia)

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:14.160
I used to kick toddlers
(In many Asian countries, big tattoos are associated with mafia)

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.370
Are you scared?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.730
You better pay up if you want to live

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:24.810
Master Duanmu,

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:27.510
our Director K wants to talk to you

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:28.920
Young Master

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:32.240
I'll teach these ruthless brats a lesson when they're back

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:36.240
I-I hope you'd forgive us

00:05:36.240 --> 00:05:37.040
Next time,

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:41.180
don't ever try to disturb those who are close to Yang Jinghua

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:42.040
Yes yes

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.010
That's...

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.000
but

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.960
what's your relationship with this Yang Jinghua,

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:49.240
whom you care so much?

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.650
Isn't this...?

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.860
So, you went to bring this?

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.740
It's the only thing that's precious in your house

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:07.160
This is the only thing that's left by my parents

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.670
They said it's was passed down from generations

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.900
I don't know what's the point of keeping it

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:14.450
It's even written "World's Number 1 Skill"

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:17.240
When it comes to me, it's all gone now

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:20.880
My dad passed away shortly I was born

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:24.120
My mom and I constantly lived away from home

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.370
She was gone too when I was 9

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.960
Great grandma then decided to take me in

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:32.160
When I first came to Duanmu household,

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.900
I was just like you

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:35.510
I lost my loved ones

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:38.440
I understand how you feel

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.100
Actually, it wasn't that bad

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.980
I was just reminiscing about suddenly coming back to a familiar place

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:45.900
Look,

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.140
it's not so bad that my parents moved on first

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:53.160
At least they don't have to cry seeing me die before them

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.870
Compared to the dead,

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:58.280
I feel pity for those who are still living

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.220
Therefore,

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:01.620
from now on I'll be your Soul Image

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.460
and also

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.100
your partner

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:06.820
Duanmu Xi

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.480
What did you say just now?

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:10.820
Starting from now,

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:15.250
you can consider me as your family

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:19.380
Family?

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.040
That's what he said?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:24.320
Little Yang's been leading a wandering life

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:27.380
I never knew he had such a good friend

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.310
I'm so happy for him

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:32.340
Did I hear wrong?

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.860
Can you repeat once more?

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:34.920
Enough

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.170
Just sit back

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.300
Why?

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:39.280
You're blocking my rear view

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.030
Duanmu Xi

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.580
Thank you

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:54.500
I don't get what you are thankful of

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.960
It doesn't matter

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.460
Family

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:05.360
Thanks to you, my lord

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.700
We gained another great earning this year

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.960
Like they say, "Forecast a great harvest"

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.360
Next year will also be a great harvest too

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:15.100
This wine's buried under the blossom since last year

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.060
Today, I'm bringing it out and heat it

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:19.140
So that we'd feel warm when we drink it

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.290
Zicheng

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.530
I'm afraid

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:25.200
this may be my last winter

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:32.760
My lord,

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.740
you shouldn't speak on such matter

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.660
Zicheng,

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.610
how many times do I need to tell you?

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.560
Don't call me "lord"

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.250
In this world,

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.130
only you understand me

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:45.380
You're like a family to me

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.450
Tell me,

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:49.110
would a family call each other "lords"?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.570
Next year

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.510
The year after

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.810
Or even for eternity

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:56.260
Yangning will always stay with you to taste the wine and watch the snow

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.100
I'm willing to do whatever you request,

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.200
even if it means losing my life

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.910
Life is like wine

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.880
Some things can't be forced

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:09.180
Being cared so much by Zicheng

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:11.190
is enough for me

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.620
Impressive as always, Zicheng

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.940
This meal is quite delicious

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.740
Perhaps, next time you

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.580
should open a restaurant

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:34.350
I can then count the money at the back

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.430
My lord

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.700
Zicheng

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.780
The wine's getting cold

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:40.770
My lord

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:44.520
"Thousand years passed like a dream",

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:48.380
"The setting of moon tilted the world's scenery"

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.300
Not "lord"

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.260
It's Luoye (Setting of moon)

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.640
Yangning Luoye

00:09:58.640 --> 00:09:59.870
Who's that?

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:03.880
The sword is burning

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.290
This is...?

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.730
It's me

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:20.230
I'm always been here

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.490
You want me to go to hell?

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:29.560
I shall make the whole place

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:31.540
hell

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.650
All

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.030
shall be killed

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:46.430
My lord

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.570
Luoye, my lord

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:49.640
Zicheng,

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.100
you've come

00:10:51.140 --> 00:10:52.920
Didn't I tell you

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.730
not to call me "lord"?

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.780
My lord!

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.030
What's wrong?

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.800
It's only an offer

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.580
You don't have to get so emotional

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:16.280
Just tell me if you need anything

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.420
I'll try...

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.280
What did you say?

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:03.730
Yang Jinghua is actually...

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.240
I'm fully certain

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.420
Yang Jinghua

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.310
is Yangning's descendant

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.720
One-armed skilled master, Yang(ning) Zicheng,

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:15.280
the one who murdered our first generation Yangming Master

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:16.640
Young Master is in danger

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:19.520
We must report to the old lady and quickly send rescue

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.650
Why feel panic?

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:23.670
If this is what Duanmu Xi's been hiding

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:26.160
Then he should know better than anyone

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.110
the kind of danger he's up against

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.180
If he wants to keep it a secret

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.480
We might as well take heed

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.900
and help him hide it from great grandma

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.220
Siyun, you...

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:41.500
Next time, I hope you don't give me these type of candies

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:43.280
If you let everyone know,

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:50.040
they'd joke about the new Yangming Master who likes eating candies meant for kids
